WEBVTT

1
00:00:08.200 --> 00:00:12.967
Miss Gray: Career Day is this Friday.

2
00:00:12.968 --> 00:00:16.137
Miss Gray: We will have lots of visitors in Room Two.

3
00:00:16.138 --> 00:00:18.448
Eve: My dad is coming!

4
00:00:18.449 --> 00:00:20.289
Daisy: My mom is coming!

5
00:00:20.290 --> 00:00:22.807
Greg: What happens on Career Day?

6
00:00:22.808 --> 00:00:26.477
Juan: Ooh! Ooh! Can I explain it to Greg?

7
00:00:26.478 --> 00:00:28.804
Miss Gray: Sure, Juan. Go ahead.

8
00:00:28.805 --> 00:00:30.951
Juan: Lots of moms and dads—

9
00:00:30.952 --> 00:00:33.126
Coby: Don't forget aunts and uncles.

10
00:00:33.127 --> 00:00:38.613
Juan: Oh, right. Well, lots of people come to tell us about their jobs.

11
00:00:38.614 --> 00:00:39.905
Greg: Why?

12
00:00:39.906 --> 00:00:42.815
Miss Gray: So we can learn about different jobs.

13
00:00:42.816 --> 00:00:46.479
Juan: And think about jobs for when we grow up.

14
00:00:46.480 --> 00:00:49.178
Maya: I want to be a doctor!

15
00:00:49.179 --> 00:00:52.744
Mark: I want to be a bug scientist!

16
00:00:52.745 --> 00:00:55.113
Kara: I want to be a princess!

17
00:00:55.114 --> 00:00:57.218
Daisy: You can't be a princess, Kara.

18
00:00:57.219 --> 00:00:58.780
That's just pretend.

19
00:00:58.781 --> 00:01:02.777
Kara: I can still try.

20
00:01:02.778 --> 00:01:09.120
Daisy: I'm going to be a teacher, just like Miss Gray.

21
00:01:09.121 --> 00:01:12.603
Jim: I can't decide what to be when I grow up.

22
00:01:12.604 --> 00:01:19.479
Miss Gray: You have plenty of time to decide, Jim.

23
00:01:19.480 --> 00:01:23.134
Mark: Is your uncle Mike coming to Career Day, Coby?

24
00:01:23.135 --> 00:01:27.544
Coby: Yes. And he's bringing the fire truck again.

25
00:01:27.545 --> 00:01:32.533
Mark: Yes! I hope he lets us try on his boots again too.

26
00:01:32.534 --> 00:01:35.441
Mark: That was cool!

27
00:01:35.442 --> 00:01:38.442
Greg: My grandpa is coming.

28
00:01:38.443 --> 00:01:41.839
He's going to talk about his job too.

29
00:01:41.840 --> 00:01:44.044
Coby: What's his job?

30
00:01:44.045 --> 00:01:45.949
Greg: I'm not telling yet.

31
00:01:45.950 --> 00:01:52.949
But it's something really cool!
